<div class="panel architecture"><div class="eyebrow">Architecture explorer · select a layer</div><div style="display:grid;gap:10px;text-align:center;margin:20px 0"><button data-layer="HTTP translates requests into application commands.">Presentation / HTTP</button><span>↓</span><button data-layer="Use cases coordinate domain behavior and transactions.">Application / use cases</button><span>↓</span><button data-layer="Aggregates and value objects protect business invariants.">Domain model</button><span>↑ implements ports</span><button data-layer="Adapters implement persistence and external integrations.">Infrastructure</button></div><p class="layer-info" aria-live="polite">Select a layer to explore its responsibilities.</p></div><script>document.querySelectorAll('.architecture').forEach(el=>el.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-layer]').forEach(btn=>btn.addEventListener('click',()=>{const info=el.querySelector('.layer-info');if(info)info.textContent=btn.dataset.layer??'';})));</script>